{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_title", "source_sha256": "d89b78c1a92edb081769505368435ad3d8cd6bc3f16edb02f22c01df28157938", "ja": "翼とおでかけ2", "zh": "和翼出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "541736d33ada594d31b3bcf1e672d25fe51964ae63ddbbddd2e16c2d5b361e73", "ja": "翼とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和翼外出的一个片刻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b5a0f9813a2803dd6a6313f404d26173fc1b689dd55543e97fa6ee1a44eeb910", "ja": "（仕事の空き時間に、翼と一緒に\n福岡の町を散歩している……）", "zh": "（工作空闲时，和翼一起在福冈的街道上散步……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "24fb8ca93bf2f9c4365d0be543f4e9ebd6440efdc14e586cc74afd56d36c8b9d", "ja": "ストリートライブしてる人たち、\nたくさんいましたね！　みんな上手だったな～。", "zh": "街头表演的人，真的有好多啊！大家都好厉害呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e8a6a7176e4bce99db458a188c3ffc9cbeaaa4204b63794e1e404750c9c7820f", "ja": "手品やダンスをしてる人もいたし、\nお祭りみたいで楽しいですね♪", "zh": "还有人表演魔术和跳舞，感觉就像在参加祭典一样，真开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "69a3436006ea54559b2c7524e91d5ccb3981590d7b14aa2413d9b0ca3d877dc0", "ja": "うん。このあたりは、本当に\n路上パフォーマーが多いみたいだな。", "zh": "嗯。这一带确实有很多\n街头艺人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0199d1d439327bfc901783cfdd70aaefad7ce98d2e10448487d401530565ef49", "ja": "ジュリアーノも毎日こういうのを見たり、\n自分でやったりしてたのかな～？", "zh": "茱莉亚以前也会每天看这种表演，或者自己上台表演吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "35e5a40423c23dc0a1d368b4c28a0f2e98f4a29de59f3c338a33fa0087f04244", "ja": "そうかもな。俺がジュリアにはじめて会った場所は、\nもうすこし先だけど……あとで行ってみるか？", "zh": "也许吧。我第一次遇见茱莉亚的地方还要再往前一点……待会儿要不要去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "577be4e092425f0314fdb9448843c9f15b72b1257c8ba95312d87715ee697f91", "ja": "はい！　……あ、でもその前に。\nちょっとだけ、お腹がすいたかも～。", "zh": "好的！……啊，不过在那之前。好像有点饿了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cb9c91f78c00f4ea3abcbc63ec2242a09e6c5d28cf3804b3b3da51c49f8c97f6", "ja": "じゃあ、先に屋台村に行こうか。\n翼、何か食べたいものがあるのか？", "zh": "那我们先去小吃摊吧。\n翼，你有没有什么想吃的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "29c7dc1d447075abbeb6e4948c9811019324149e2201e0ffb25cdbe00d1948db", "ja": "えっと、何がいいかな～？　本場のとんこつラーメンも\n気になるし、もつ鍋もおいしそうだし……♪", "zh": "那个，我该选什么好呢～？正宗的豚骨拉面也很让人在意，牛杂火锅看起来也很好吃……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_016tsu02_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5d5510eb8787743082723ef92e2dc2b0ddfe08197c6163ded75e0aadfe00bb52", "ja": "でも{$P$}さんといっしょなら、\nなんでもおいしいと思うけど！　じゃ、行きましょ～♪", "zh": "不过只要和{$P$}先生一起，吃什么我都觉得好吃！那我们走吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
